.SH "نام (NAME)"
timew-cancel \- cancel time tracking
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fBtimew cancel\fP
.fi
.br
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
If there is an open interval, it is abandoned.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.sp
\fBCancel with active time tracking\fP
.RS 4
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
$ timew start
\&...
$ timew cancel
Canceled active time tracking.
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.RE
.sp
This deletes the open interval.
.sp
\fBCancel with no active time tracking\fP
.RS 4
.sp
.if n .RS 4
.nf
.fam C
\&...
$ timew stop
$ timew cancel
There is no active time tracking.
.fam
.fi
.if n .RE
.RE
.sp
Cancel has no effect, only a warning is printed.
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.sp
\fBtimew\-continue\fP(1),
\fBtimew\-start\fP(1),
\fBtimew\-stop\fP(1),
\fBtimew\-track\fP(1)